Usage: npx storybook skills [options] [id]

Agent skills served by this Storybook.

Options:
  --cwd <path>                 Project directory of the target Storybook
  -c, --config-dir <dir-name>  Storybook config directory of the target Storybook
  --all                        Print every skill in full
  -h, --help                   Show this usage and every skill

Skills:
  stories      The mandatory, ordered workflow for UI changes: discover affected stories, test, and present results.
  write-story  How to write, update, and test Storybook stories for this project: imports, patterns, and conventions.
  setup        Setup instructions to write stories for the real components in this project.

Print a skill with `npx storybook skills <id>`, or every skill with `npx storybook skills --all`.
